@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Introduction to Agile Scrum";
    ViewData["ActiveMenu"] = "AzureDevOps";
}

<div class="container py-4">
    <p class="lead text-center">Agile Scrum is a popular framework for managing complex projects through iterative development, collaboration, and continuous improvement.</p>
    <hr />

    <!-- What is Agile Scrum? -->
    <div class="mt-4">
        <h2 class="text-success">What is Agile Scrum?</h2>
        <p>
            Agile Scrum is an iterative and incremental framework for project management and software development. It emphasizes collaboration, flexibility, and customer feedback to deliver high-quality products efficiently.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/agile-scrum-overview.jpg" alt="Agile Scrum Overview" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Scrum focuses on collaboration and iterative development cycles.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Key Components of Scrum -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-warning">Key Components of Scrum</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Scrum Team:</strong> Includes the Product Owner, Scrum Master, and Development Team.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Scrum Artifacts:</strong> Product Backlog, Sprint Backlog, and Increment.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Scrum Events:</strong> Sprint Planning, Daily Scrum, Sprint Review, and Sprint Retrospective.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Scrum Roles:</strong> Defines the responsibilities of each team member to ensure smooth collaboration.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/scrum-framework.jpg" alt="Scrum Framework" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>The Scrum framework helps teams deliver high-value products efficiently.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Benefits of Agile Scrum -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-danger">Benefits of Agile Scrum</h2>
        <ul class="list-group list-group-flush">
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Faster Delivery:</strong> Enables quicker releases and continuous delivery of features.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Enhanced Collaboration:</strong> Encourages teamwork and communication among stakeholders.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Flexibility:</strong> Adapts to changing requirements and customer needs.</li>
            <li class="list-group-item"><strong>Continuous Improvement:</strong> Iterative feedback loops ensure constant learning and optimization.</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/agile-scrum-benefits.jpg" alt="Benefits of Agile Scrum" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Scrum fosters innovation, collaboration, and rapid product development.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Conclusion -->
    <div class="mt-5">
        <h2 class="text-secondary">Conclusion</h2>
        <p>
            Agile Scrum is a powerful methodology that helps teams develop products efficiently while maintaining high adaptability. By following Scrum principles, teams can enhance collaboration, deliver valuable software, and continuously improve their processes.
        </p>
        <div class="text-center my-3">
            <img src="https://example.com/scrum-summary.jpg" alt="Agile Scrum Summary" class="img-fluid rounded shadow-lg w-100">
            <p class="text-muted mt-2"><small>Scrum helps teams stay agile and customer-focused.</small></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
